@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor LOGIC_COLOR_T4
skinparam classBackgroundColor LOGIC_COLOR
skinparam ClassAttributeFontColor white
title Proposed undo/redo history (not implemented)

class LogicManager
class UndoRedoHistory {
    currentIndex: int
}
class HistoryEntry {
    commandDescription: String
}
class TAssist MODEL_COLOR

show UndoRedoHistory members
show HistoryEntry members
LogicManager --> "1" UndoRedoHistory : history
UndoRedoHistory *--> "1..*" HistoryEntry : entries {ordered}
HistoryEntry *--> "1" TAssist : snapshot

note bottom of UndoRedoHistory
  Proposed classes: UndoRedoHistory and HistoryEntry.
  The index moves only after saving succeeds.
  Snapshots are private copies of complete TAssist data.
end note
@enduml
